<title>LITHUANIA: VILNIAUS BANK BALANCE SHEET FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>VILNIAUS BANK BALANCE SHEET FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is the balance sheet as of</p>
<p>December 31, 1996, for Lithuania's Vilniaus Bank. All figures in</p>
<p>thousands of litas.</p>
<p>Assets</p>
<p>    Cash on hand				    53.228</p>
<p>    Balances with the Bank of Lithuania     100.446</p>
<p>    Due from banks				  229.230</p>
<p>    Loans and advances to customers	   356.281</p>
<p>    Treasury bonds and other investments    94.746</p>
<p>    Financial lease receivable		   -</p>
<p>    Prepayments and accured income	    8.489</p>
<p>    Fixed assets				    72.231</p>
<p>    Total assets				    914.651</p>
<p>Liabilities</p>
<p>    Amounts owed to credit institutions     184.095</p>
<p>    Deposits from the public		    589.627</p>
<p>    Other short term liabilities		15.516</p>
<p>    Share capital payable			 5.000</p>
<p>    Provisions, accruals and deferred income2.317</p>
<p>    Dividends declared			    1.010</p>
<p>    Total liabilities			     797.565</p>
<p>Equity</p>
<p>    Paid in capital				 102.000</p>
<p>    Restricted retained earnings		15.024</p>
<p>    Unapropriated retained earnings	   62</p>
<p>    Total equity				    117.086</p>
<p>    Total liabilities and equity		914.651</p>
<p>    Return on Average Shareholder's Equity  35.79 percent</p>
<p>    Return on Average Total Assets	    4.15 percent</p>
</text>
